OL,3,GNEWSADriver and children 'petrified' in
OL,4,Abus attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver has described an attack on
OL,7,Fhis vehicle by masked youths as
OL,8,F"scary", leaving children on board
OL,9,F"petrified and squealing".
OL,11,FTony McBride spoke out after the
OL,12,FTranslink bus was attacked a number of
OL,13,Ftimes by missiles in the Lecky Road
OL,14,Farea of Londonderry on Saturday at
OL,15,Fabout 18:25 BST.
OL,17,FHe said two children and elderly people
OL,18,Fwere on board and, although not
OL,19,Finjured, were left shaken.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
