OL,5,
OL,6,F"Damage was caused to five windows,
OL,7,Fincluding the front window of the bus
OL,8,Ffollowing the incident, Ch Supt Gillian
OL,9,FKearney from the Police Service of
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said.
